## 5. Distributed Risk Assessment & Rollback Protocols
| Risk Description | Severity | Mitigation Strategy | Rollback Action |
|---|---|---|---|
| Kafka message duplication during rebalance | High | Enforce database or Redis-based idempotency key deduplication | Repoint consumer to pause processing; re-enable legacy worker |
| Redis cache stampede under peak load | High | Implement mutex locking or probabilistic early expiration | Gracefully fallback to read replicas in database |
| Outbox event publication failure | Critical | Transactional outbox pattern: event written in same DB tx as entity | Automatic retry loop with alert escalation |
```

